{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_010_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:016e6b1870696be9fbea3525e4006d357cb3c58f0d19af137167087f55810116",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7928d7cc03ff8999486e0239e63b155711c58f5f1aaeea255a59120ede31a647",
      "text": "你看你看，●●●●プロデューサー！\n电视剧的剧本送到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e764c0ec8343d58cc3824884e213ba19e264ca248808a56bca07ba61a6a1b13",
      "text": "好的。那我们赶快先过目一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c9c444e7d768ee92822dee5c1efaeb18415ba2360084977ee416afbc845284",
      "text": "嗯！……哇啊。\n有好多难懂的汉字，好难……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e1faf704b1819ca907e52161d68346e74316fbc4e9f7488ab20492c885757c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n想让你帮忙标读音……可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbf5a798e3679431f9b045b04425c6e597b11b49fc575da57c0243820b27849",
      "text": "当然可以了。机会难得，\n我们就一边查一边写上去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c26f13e796ee6fcd832eba9ccd2e27b0fb2cb996c48320deff34e737bb04f7",
      "text": "这样一来也能顺便练习汉字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31e9aaf06b18cf3c1c5c30816304667aa9dc3cf3ee08e389a3b07547ad1ed615",
      "text": "嗯，知道了！练汉字就像上学一样。\n我好期待♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e635c6f6ac208cb258a9b9b96a37415a20bac213680b5f81aff28122aca7c875",
      "text": "啊……我的角色，有跳华尔兹的镜头。\n剧本上写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0dec45e632beaa91438b49e8054ea7f05287501d95009c720d90c212ff4b3c",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n会跳华尔兹吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d8d4847bf13c7f9c3cbd82920b091ba555e2587ad6f2114fb746425ad3fa43",
      "text": "哎，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
